cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or this code, please cite as below."
title: "Indus script: machine-readable seal catalogues from Mackay (1938) and Marshall (1931), with photo-coded text features and a reproducible analysis pipeline"
abstract: "Two hand-transcribed, machine-readable catalogues of Mohenjo-daro seals with find-spots and levels; text features coded from all thirteen of Mackay's seal plates; a held-out validated constraint set on Indus sign sequences; and a reproducible pipeline of genre- and size-matched structural comparisons against Sumerian, Egyptian, Aegean and proto-cuneiform corpora. Results are mainly negative and documented as such. No decipherment is offered."
authors:
  - family-names: Koshy
    given-names: Nitin Stephen
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-2690-0588"
version: 0.2.2
date-released: 2026-09-20
